cross/createPlace">
      <bpmn2:documentation id="_CPL_DOC_0046"><![CDATA[Creates the PLACE node in CROSS (POST /v1/node/) inside crossProjectName with the SMW building id as PNI_DE external id and the ADDRESS reference to the address master id, so the SMW probe can assume the node later. (CREATE_OR_UPDATE)]]></bpmn2:documentation>
